  "intro_1": {
   "bytes": 107460,
   "sha256": "799ec70f4681e6906a558fc222448c0eefc29f99fb4aab9abd1941af5ce09c6a",
   "text": "11:52 pm. Mum and Dad are stuck across town in the storm, and you're watching your little sister Mira. Twenty minutes ago she slipped outside after the cat. Now the intercom crackles: both door cameras show a small figure in her yellow raincoat, at the front door and the side door, at the same time. One call, two doors."
  },
  "intro_2": {
   "bytes": 59002,
   "sha256": "be5d42ae3e4f2d59a3048944cfc9145f64d33aebcd102b23905c8f4e45eb2da3",
   "text": "12:20 am. She calls again. Same raincoat, same little voice, both doors. Mum's rule, taped to the fridge: “Never open the door at night unless you're sure who it is.”"
  },
  "intro_3": {
   "bytes": 47900,
   "sha256": "65ab77630ba9fdbc28a52fa87acf6a3e0368ece44ac9ff5a15200c3a4710319b",
   "text": "1:05 am. The porch light on one side won't stop flickering. Another call. Tonight the call leans toward one of the doors."
  },
  "intro_4": {
   "bytes": 54170,
   "sha256": "f17405d662f2de4431e4cd9de5694b91429fd97fe0f959e0b5bad74d023c47f0",
   "text": "3:33 am. The intercom battery is almost dead. One more call. Somewhere out in the rain, something has learned exactly how she says your name."
  },
  "res_saved": {
   "bytes": 7019,
   "sha256": "aa570c6bae2a05f105dd5dda77ad27b64033c6248389c0309089427365cbad4e",
   "text": "You took forever."
  },
  "res_wrong": {
   "bytes": 5843,
